# No Em Dashes

Never use em dashes (—) or en dashes (–) anywhere in this project: UI copy, markdown, comments, metadata, schema, or commits.

## Use instead

- Comma, colon, or period to break a clause
- Hyphen with spaces (` - `) for an aside
- Parentheses for a parenthetical

```text
❌ We collect what we need — your name and address.
✅ We collect what we need - your name and address.
✅ We collect what we need: your name and address.
```

```text
❌ /* Hero entrance — keep visible if CSS fails */
✅ /* Hero entrance - keep visible if CSS fails */
```

If you find existing em/en dashes, replace them before finishing the task.
